    "After you copy, Copymunk writes the item back to the system clipboard and hands focus back to the app you came from. You press ⌘V yourself — Copymunk never pastes for you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nach dem Kopieren legt Copymunk den Eintrag zurück in die Systemzwischenablage und gibt den Fokus an die App zurück, aus der du gekommen bist. Einsetzen musst du selbst mit ⌘V – Copymunk setzt nie für dich ein."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après la copie, Copymunk remet l’élément dans le presse-papiers du système et rend la main à l’app d’où vous venez. C’est vous qui appuyez sur ⌘V — Copymunk ne colle jamais à votre place."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制后 Copymunk 把内容写回系统剪贴板并把焦点交还给原来的 App，由你自己按 ⌘V —— Copymunk 从不代你粘贴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alle"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always copy as plain text": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Immer als reinen Text kopieren"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toujours copier en texte brut"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始终以纯文本复制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always on": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Immer an"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toujours activé"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始终开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any folder all of your devices share works — for example a folder inside iCloud Drive, or a company drive. Copymunk keeps its files in its own subfolder and can only reach the folder you pick here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jeder Ordner, den alle deine Geräte gemeinsam nutzen, funktioniert – zum Beispiel ein Ordner in iCloud Drive oder ein Firmenlaufwerk. Copymunk legt seine Dateien in einem eigenen Unterordner ab und kann nur auf den Ordner zugreifen, den du hier auswählst."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "N’importe quel dossier partagé par tous vos appareils convient — par exemple un dossier dans iCloud Drive ou un disque d’entreprise. Copymunk place ses fichiers dans son propre sous-dossier et n’a accès qu’au dossier que vous choisissez ici."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任意多台设备都能共享的文件夹皆可，例如 iCloud Drive 里的某个文件夹或公司共享盘。Copymunk 会把自己的文件放在其中的专属子文件夹里，且只能访问你在此选定的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anything you copy shows up here. Copymunk records it in the background — there is nothing you need to do.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles, was du kopierst, erscheint hier. Copymunk erfasst es im Hintergrund – du musst nichts tun."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout ce que vous copiez apparaît ici. Copymunk l’enregistre en arrière-plan, vous n’avez rien à faire."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制任何东西，它都会出现在这里。Copymunk 在后台自动记录，不需要你做任何事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies when you press ↩. ⇧↩ always copies as plain text.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gilt, wenn du ↩ drückst. ⇧↩ kopiert immer als reinen Text."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S’applique quand vous appuyez sur ↩. ⇧↩ copie toujours en texte brut."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按 ↩ 时生效。⇧↩ 始终以纯文本复制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Available": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verfügbar"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
